});
```
For Mortal, current stage display should "INITIAL". Also passed count dynamic. Header "SPIRIT CULTIVATION · 15 REALMS" maybe "SPIRIT CULTIVATION · MORTAL + 15 REALMS". Body header 15. "Every spirit realm holds..." add Mortal exception.

Also next threshold for Mortal needs special message "Awaken into Qi Condensation I". `goal` nextPathCost. `state.spirit.stage>=9` check false for Mortal. Could say "The first awakening is a guaranteed qi upgrade." Good.

